    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q113650759"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F is a 2024 American action comedy film directed by Mark Molloy, written by Will Beall, Tom Gormican, and Kevin Etten from a story by Beall, the fourth installment in the Beverly Hills Cop film series and a sequel to Beverly Hills Cop III (1994). Eddie Murphy, Judge Reinhold, John Ashton, Paul Reiser, and Bronson Pinchot reprise their roles from previous films in the franchise, while Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Taylour Paige, and Kevin Bacon star in new roles. The film was Ashton's final role; he died two months following its release.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <rdfs:label>Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
  </rdf:Description>
