    <ns2:sourceSummary>Boxcutter is a 2024 Canadian drama film, produced and directed by Reza Dahya. The film stars Ashton James as Rome, an aspiring rapper in Toronto who must try to find and recover his laptop, containing all of his song demo files, when it is stolen shortly before an important meeting with a music producer.</ns2:sourceSummary>
