    <ns2:sourceSummary>Chiclets is a 2024 Indian teen drama film written and directed by Muthu M. Shot simultaneously in Tamil and Telugu, the film stars Sathvik Varma, Jack Robinson and Nayan Karishma in the lead roles. The film was produced by S Srinivasan Guru under the banner of SSB Films.</ns2:sourceSummary>
