    <rdfs:label>Appa I Love You</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Appa I Love You is a 2024 Indian Kannada-language family drama film directed by Athrav Arya and starring Prem, Tabla Nani in the titular role, and Manvitha Kamath, Vikas and Jeevitha Vasishta. The film's title is named after a song in Chowka (2017). The film was theatrically released on 12 April 2024 and received mixed-to-negative reviews.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>Appa I Love You</ns2:title>
  </rdf:Description>
