    <rdfs:label>Bookworm (film)</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bookworm is a 2024 New Zealand adventure comedy drama film directed by Ant Timpson from a screenplay by Toby Harvard, based on a story by Timpson and Harvard. It stars Elijah Wood and Nell Fisher. The film follows a young girl embarking on an adventure with her estranged American father to seek out the mythical Canterbury panther.</ns2:sourceSummary>
