    <ns2:sourceSummary>Cabrini is a 2024 American biographical drama film directed by Alejandro Gómez Monteverde and written by Rod Barr, based on a story by both. The film depicts the life of Catholic missionary Francesca Cabrini, portrayed by Cristiana Dell'Anna, as she encounters resistance to her charity and business efforts in New York City. Cabrini explores the sexism and anti-Italian bigotry faced by Cabrini and others in New York City in the late 19th century.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:cinematographyBy rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_gorka_gomez_andreu"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
