    <ns2:sourceSummary>Catching Fire: The Story of Anita Pallenberg is a 2024 documentary film about The Rolling Stones muse Anita Pallenberg. The film is based on Pallenberg's unpublished autobiography Black Magic that her children found after her death in 2017; passages from the document are read out in the film by Scarlett Johansson.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>Catching Fire: The Story of Anita Pallenberg</ns2:title>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
