    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bagheera is a 2024 Indian Kannada-language superhero film written and directed by Dr. Suri, from a story by Prashanth Neel, and produced by Vijay Kiragandur. It stars Sriimurali, alongside Rukmini Vasanth, Prakash Raj, Sudha Rani, Ramachandra Raju, Achyuth Kumar and Rangayana Raghu. The music was composed by B. Ajaneesh Loknath, while the cinematography and editing were handled by Arjun Shetty and Pranav Sri Prasad.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:hasCountry rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_india"/>
