    <ns2:sourceSummary>Filmlovers! is a 2024 docufiction drama film written and directed by Arnaud Desplechin. It stars Milo Machado-Graner, Mathieu Amalric and Françoise Lebrun. It features the character of Paul Dédalus, who appeared in Desplechin's earlier films My Sex Life... or How I Got into an Argument (1996), A Christmas Tale (2008) and My Golden Days (2015). According to Desplechin the film is meant to "celebrate movie theaters and their manifold magic".</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
