    <ns2:title>Aserb: The Squadron</ns2:title>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Aserb: The Squadron is a 2024 Egyptian action film directed by Ahmed Nader Galal and written by Omar Abdel Halim. The film stars Ahmed El Sakka, Amr Abdulgalil, and Kosai Khauli. Its story is based on true events of the Egyptian National Security Agency's response to the 2015 kidnapping and beheading of Copts in Libya.</ns2:sourceSummary>
