    <ns2:sourceSummary>Dead Man's Switch is a 2024 Mexican melodrama film written, co-produced and directed by Alejandro Gerber Bicecci. It stars Adriana Paz as a Mexico City Metro driver who seeks to find her missing husband, dealing with the reprimands of Mexican bureaucracy, her work environment and her own family.</ns2:sourceSummary>
