    <ns2:sourceSummary>Buddy is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language fantasy action film written and directed by Sam Anton and produced by K. E. Gnanavel Raja and Aadhana Gnanavelraja under the banner of Studio Green. The film stars Allu Sirish, Gayatri Bhardwaj, Prisha Rajesh Singh, and Ajmal Ameer in prominent roles. The soundtrack and background score were composed by Hiphop Tamizha, while the cinematography and editing were handled by Krishnan Vasant and Ruben. The film is an adaptation of the Tamil film Teddy.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <rdfs:label>Buddy (2024 film)</rdfs:label>
