    <ns2:title>Fighter (2024 film)</ns2:title>
    <ns2:pageURL rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fighter_(2024_film)</ns2:pageURL>
    <ns2:imdbId>tt13818368</ns2:imdbId>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Fighter is a 2024 Indian Hindi-language aerial action film directed by Siddharth Anand and produced by his production company Marflix Pictures and Viacom18 Studios. It stars Hrithik Roshan, Deepika Padukone, Anil Kapoor, Karan Singh Grover, and Akshay Oberoi. The first instalment of a planned aerial action franchise, the film depicts a series of military incidents between India and Pakistan in 2019, covering the Pulwama attack, the 2019 Balakot airstrike, and the India–Pakistan border skirmishes.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <rdfs:label>Fighter (2024 film)</rdfs:label>
