    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Damned is a 2024 drama film produced, written and directed by Roberto Minervini. Starring a large amateur cast, it follows a group of volunteer Union soldiers in 1862 during the American Civil War, in an isolated unknown location. Most of the dialogue were improvised by the cast during the shooting on location in Montana.</ns2:sourceSummary>
