    <ns2:sourceSummary>Be My Guest, Be My Baby is a 2024 Japanese romantic comedy film directed by Mitsuhito Shiraha, starring Koki Maeda and Razel Ichimiya. An adaptation of the Kosho Nakashima book The Sociology of Filipino Pub Women, it follows a graduate student doing research on female foreign workers in Japan as he falls in love with a Filipino pub hostess.</ns2:sourceSummary>
