    <ns2:sourceSummary>Gaabh is a 2024 Indian Marathi-language dark comedy-drama film written and directed by Anup Jatratkar and produced by Timelapse Productions and Multimedia Productions. The film features Kailash Waghmare, Sayali Bandkar in the leading roles. Gaabh won the Maharashtra State Film Award for Best Rural Film at 60th Maharashtra State Film Awards.</ns2:sourceSummary>
