    <ns2:sourceSummary>Byri is a 2024 Indian Tamil-language action drama film directed by John Glady and starring himself, Syed Majeed, Meghana Ellen and, Viji Sekar with the music by Arun Raj. The film is about pigeon racing in Nagercoil, and it was released on 23 February 2024 to mixed-to-positive reviews from critics but couldn't perform well at the box office.</ns2:sourceSummary>
