    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Finnish Line is a 2024 American romantic comedy Christmas television film directed by Dustin Rikert. It tells the story of Anya, a Finnish-American woman who, following in her late father's footsteps, arrives in Finnish Lapland to participate in a sled dog competition. The film stars Kim Matula, Beau Mirchoff and Nichole Sakura.</ns2:sourceSummary>
