    <rdfs:label>Following (2024 film)</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Following is a 2024 South Korean mystery thriller film written and directed by Kim Se-hwi, starring Byun Yo-han, Shin Hye-sun, and Lee El. The film follows a realtor who habitually sneaks into his clients' homes and becomes obsessed with a deceptive social media influencer. It was released theatrically on May 15, 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
