    <ns2:sourceSummary>Cha-Cha is a 2024 Japanese romantic comedy-drama film directed by Mai Sakai, starring Marika Itō and Taishi Nakagawa. It follows the titular protagonist, a free-spirited artist and illustrator, as she meets and falls in love with an introverted man. The film is the fourth instalment in the "(not) HEROINE movies" series.</ns2:sourceSummary>
