    <ns2:title>Bootcut Balaraju</ns2:title>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bootcut Balaraju is a 2024 Indian Telugu-lanaguage romantic comedy film written and directed by Sree Koneti. The film was produced by Md. Pasha under the banner of Katha Verunthadi Productions and Global films. The film stars Syed Sohel as the titular character alongside Meghalekha, Sunil, Indraja in lead roles, Syed Sohel also debut in as a producer with film.</ns2:sourceSummary>
