    <ns2:sourceSummary>Fureytha is a 2024 Maldivian revenge thriller action film directed by Ali Shifau. Produced by Mohamed Ali and Aishath Fuad Thaufeeq under Dark Rain Entertainment, the film stars Sharaf Abdulla, Ravee Farooq, Mohamed Manik and Ahmed Saeed in pivotal roles. The film was released on 4 March 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
