    <rdfs:label>Christmas in Lagos</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Christmas in Lagos is a 2024 Nigerian romantic comedy-drama film written and directed by Jadesola Osiberu. Produced by Greoh Studios, the film explores the vibrant culture of Lagos, Nigeria, during the Christmas season. It features a mix of humor, romance, and family drama and captures the essence of celebrating Christmas in the bustling city. cast members include Richard Mofe-Damijo, Teniola Aladese, Shaffy Bello, Ladipoe, Shalom C. Obiago, Rayxia Ojo, Ebele Okaro-Onyiuke, and Ejike Asiegbu.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>Christmas in Lagos</ns2:title>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
