    <ns2:sourceSummary>Brewster's Millions: Christmas is an American Christmas family film written and directed by Patricia Cuffie-Jones. It is a sequel for the 1985 comedy film Brewster's Millions starring Richard Pryor and based on the 1902 novel of the same name by George Barr McCutcheon. It stars China Anne McClain and Romeo Miller. The character of Montgomery Brewster is portrayed by Richard Pryor's son, Richard Pryor Jr. as Montgomery Brewster Jr., son of the Montgomery Brewster which Richard Pryor played in the first movie.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
