    <ns2:sourceSummary>Barah x Barah (transl. 12x12) is a 2024 Indian Hindi-language film directed by Gaurav Madan. It stars Gyanendra Tripathi, Geetika Vidya Ohlyan, Bhumika Dube. The movie depicts life in Varanasi, one of India's oldest cities as it undergoes gradual changes.</ns2:sourceSummary>
