    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bhale Unnade is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language romantic comedy-drama film directed by J. Sivasai Vardhan. It stars Raj Tarun and Manisha Kandkur in the lead roles, with supporting performances by Abhirami, Singeetam Srinivasa Rao, and others. The film explores contemporary themes of gender dynamics and relationships, focusing on a protagonist who defies traditional masculinity.</ns2:sourceSummary>
