    <ns2:sourceSummary>Apartment 7A is a 2024 American psychological horror film serving as a prequel to Rosemary's Baby (1968). Directed and co-written by Natalie Erika James, the film stars Julia Garner, Dianne Wiest, Jim Sturgess, and Kevin McNally. The story sees a young dancer who, after suffering an injury that risks her career, receives help from a Broadway producer and an older couple with sinister ulterior motives.</ns2:sourceSummary>
