    <ns2:title>The Fuji Documentary</ns2:title>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Fuji Documentary is a historical documentary film produced and directed by Saheed Aderinto. The first episode titled Mr. Fuji: Barry Wonder details the life and times of Sikiru Ayinde Barrister (1948–2010), the creator of Fuji Music. It premiered in Ibadan in February 2024. Subsequent episodes of The Fuji Documentary will be released over ten years.</ns2:sourceSummary>
