    <ns2:sourceSummary>Breathe is a 2024 American science fiction thriller film directed by Stefon Bristol, written by Doug Simon, and starring Jennifer Hudson, Milla Jovovich, Quvenzhané Wallis, Common, and Sam Worthington. The film is set in a world where oxygen levels on Earth have dropped making it impossible to live on the planet's surface without specialised equipment. It was released on April 26, 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>Breathe (2024 film)</ns2:title>
