    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q113012523"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Blink Twice is a 2024 American psychological thriller film directed and produced by Zoë Kravitz from a script she wrote with E.T. Feigenbaum. The film stars Naomi Ackie, Channing Tatum, Christian Slater, Simon Rex, Adria Arjona, Haley Joel Osment, Kyle MacLachlan, Geena Davis, and Alia Shawkat. It tells the story of a group of people invited to the private island of a billionaire tech mogul as something strange and sinister happens with the attendees.</ns2:sourceSummary>
