    <ns2:sourceSummary>Friendship is a 2024 American black comedy film written and directed by Andrew DeYoung in his feature directorial debut. It stars Tim Robinson, Kate Mara, Jack Dylan Grazer, and Paul Rudd. The story follows Craig, a socially awkward marketing executive, and his increasingly fraught bond with his new neighbor, Austin, a local TV meteorologist.</ns2:sourceSummary>
