    <ns2:sourceSummary>A Brother and 7 Siblings is a 2024 drama film written and directed by Yandy Laurens, based on 1996 sinetron of the same name by Arswendo Atmowiloto. The film stars Chicco Kurniawan as a man who suddenly has to take care of his nieces and nephews after the death of his older sister.</ns2:sourceSummary>
