    <ns2:sourceSummary>Athomugam is a 2024 Indian Tamil-language drama thriller film written and directed by Sunil Dev. The film stars S P Siddarth, Chaitanya Pratap, Sarithiran, and Ananth Nag in lead roles. The film was simultaneously shot in Malayalam. The Tamil version of the film was theatrically released on 1 March 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
