    <ns2:sourceSummary>Big World is a 2024 Chinese coming-of-age drama film directed by Yang Lina. It follows Liu Chunhe, a young man with cerebral palsy, who overcomes challenges to fulfill his grandmother's dream. The film premiered at the 37th Tokyo International Film Festival, and was released theatrically on 27 December 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
