  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/movie#film_Q130558712">
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Average Student Nani is a 2024 Telugu-language Indian romantic drama film produced by Pawan Kumar Kothuri and Bishali Geol under Sri Neelakanta Mahadeva Entertainments LLP banner and written and directed by also Pawan Kumar Kothuri. It also features Pawan Kumar Kothuri, Sabiha Bhasin and Sneha Malviya are in lead roles while Rajeev Kanakala, Viviya Santh, Jhansi, Khaleja Giri, Bindu and others are in supporting roles. The music of the film composed by Karthik B Kodakandla.</ns2:sourceSummary>
