    <ns2:sourceSummary>Dear Gentlemen is a 2024 Colombian drama film written and directed by Patricia Castañeda. The film explores the history of women's suffrage in Colombia and marks Castañeda's feature directorial debut. The film won ten awards at the 2025 Macondo Awards.</ns2:sourceSummary>
