    <ns2:imdbId>tt31513578</ns2:imdbId>
    <rdfs:label>Death Whisperer 2</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Death Whisperer 2 also known as Tee Yod 2 is a 2024 Thai supernatural horror film directed by Taweewat Wantha, starring by Nadech Kugimiya, Denise Jelilcha Kappun, Kajbundit Jaidee, Peerakrit Phacharabunyakiat, Rattanawadee Wongthong, Natcha Nina Jessica Padowan, Arisara Wongchalee, and Pramet Noi-am. It is a sequel to Death Whisperer (2023). Like the first installment, the film was shot entirely for IMAX release. It is based on a true story that occurred in 1972 in Dan Makham Tia District, Kanchanaburi Province, and was embellished for entertainment purposes in the style of the Evil Dead series by Sam Raimi, which served as an inspiration for the first installment.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:hasCountry rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_thailand"/>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q124748407"/>
  </rdf:Description>
