  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/movie#film_Q125400786">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Beach Boys is a 2024 American musical documentary film directed by Frank Marshall and Thom Zimmy focused on the American rock band the Beach Boys. Featuring interviews from band members Brian Wilson, Mike Love, Al Jardine, David Marks and Bruce Johnston, as well as archival footage of Carl Wilson and Dennis Wilson, the film examines the band's history beginning with their formation up until the mid-1970s. The film also features appearances from Janelle Monáe, Lindsey Buckingham, Ryan Tedder and Don Was.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:hasGenre rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_documentary_film"/>
