    <ns2:sourceSummary>Breathing Underwater is a 2024 Luxembourgish drama film co-written and directed by Eric Lamhène. The film is an emotional, character-driven drama set in the secretive world of a women's shelter. The film had its world premiere at the Warsaw Film Festival on 12 October 2024. It competed in the 1-2 Competition section.</ns2:sourceSummary>
