    <ns2:hasCastMember rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_shamla_hamza"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Feminichi Fathima is an Indian Malayalam-language film written and directed by Fasil Muhammed. The film is a social drama that explores themes of gender equality, cultural traditions, and personal empowerment through the lens of its protagonist, Fathima. Shamla Hamza won the Kerala State Film Award for Best Actress for her performance in the film.</ns2:sourceSummary>
