    <ns2:sourceSummary>Cura sana is a 2024 Spanish short drama film written and directed by Lucía G. Romero. It tells the story of two sisters, Jessica and Alma, who are victims of domestic violence at home and therefore treat each other with violence.</ns2:sourceSummary>
