    <ns2:title>Art of Love (2024 film)</ns2:title>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Art of Love is a 2024 Turkish romance film directed by Recai Karagöz, written by Pelin Karamehmetoğlu. The film stars Birkan Sokullu, Esra Bilgiç and Fırat Tanış. It was released on Netflix on 14 March 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
