    <ns2:sourceSummary>Carnaval is a 2024 Peruvian documentary film written and directed by Gabriel Tejada and José Osorio. It reviews the history of the Cajamarca festival from its origins to the present day and whose gastronomy, music and characters unite an entire town. It premiered on February 1, 2024, in Cajamarca theaters.</ns2:sourceSummary>
