    <ns2:sourceSummary>Canary Black is a 2024 action-thriller film directed by Pierre Morel and written by Matthew Kennedy. The film stars Kate Beckinsale as a CIA agent who is blackmailed into undertaking missions in exchange for her kidnapped husband's life. It was released on October 24, 2024 by Amazon MGM Studios to generally negative reviews.</ns2:sourceSummary>
