    <rdfs:label>Forget Me Not (2024 film)</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Forget Me Not is a 2024 Bengali-language Bangladeshi romantic psychological drama film. Robiul Alam Robi wrote the screenplay and dialogues along with the direction. Starring Yash Rohan and Mehazabien Chowdhury in the lead roles. This is Ministry of Love's 4th film, which was released on OTT Chorki on 5 September 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:directedBy rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_robiul_alam_robi"/>
    <ns2:imdbId>tt33296158</ns2:imdbId>
