    <ns2:sourceSummary>A Good Day Will Come is a 2024 short fiction film directed and written by Amir Zargara. The story follows Arash, a dedicated professional wrestler striving to win gold medals for his country, only to be caught in the turmoil of political unrest and societal hardship. He faces a choice between standing against tyranny and maintaining his personal ambitions.</ns2:sourceSummary>
