    <ns2:sourceSummary>Gazer is a 2024 American psychological mystery thriller film directed, written, produced, and edited by Ryan J. Sloan, in his feature directorial debut. The film's story follows Frankie Rhodes, who struggles to perceive time, in which she takes a risky job from a mysterious woman to support her family.</ns2:sourceSummary>
