    <rdfs:label>Dayarani</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Dayarani is a 2024 Nepali family-drama film written and directed by Maotse Gurung. The film is the directorial debut for actor Gurung. It's produced by Mohan Gurung, New IT Venture, Kiran Gurung, Kendra Limbu, Maj. Khusiman Gurung MVO, Capt. Surendra Gurung &amp; Capt. Surya Prakash Gurung under the banner of Maotse Gurung Films and Baasuri Films. It features Dayahang Rai, Diya Pun &amp; Bijay Baral in pivotal roles. The story revolves around the poignant journey of a couple grappling with the challenges of infertility.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>Dayarani</ns2:title>
    <ns2:pageURL rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dayarani</ns2:pageURL>
