    <rdfs:label>Flight 404 (film)</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Flight 404 is a 2024 Egyptian thriller drama film directed by Hani Khalifa starring Mona Zaki, with a script by Mohamed Ragaa, and produced by Mohamed Hefzy. It was selected as the Egyptian submission for the Best International Feature Film at the 97th Academy Awards, but was not nominated.</ns2:sourceSummary>
