    <ns2:sourceSummary>Carry-On is a 2024 American action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra and written by T. J. Fixman. The film stars Taron Egerton, Sofia Carson, Danielle Deadwyler, and Jason Bateman. Its plot follows a young TSA officer who is blackmailed into allowing a nerve agent on board a flight, which will kill 250 people, during Christmas Eve.</ns2:sourceSummary>
