    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Bad Guys: Haunted Heist is a 2024 CG animated Halloween heist comedy short film based on the 2022 film The Bad Guys, which in turn is based on the graphic novel series of the same name. This was the second special based on the film after A Very Bad Holiday, with the cast of said special reprising their roles for Haunted Heist.</ns2:sourceSummary>
