    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Belle from Gaza is a 2024 French documentary film written, shot, co-edited, co-produced and directed by Yolande Zauberman. The film follows Zauberman's pursuit of a trans woman who traveled on foot to Tel Aviv from Gaza.</ns2:sourceSummary>
