    <ns2:sourceSummary>Dan Da Dan: First Encounter is a 2024 Japanese animated science fiction action comedy horror film, consisting of the first three episodes of the anime television series adaptation of the manga series Dandadan by Yukinobu Tatsu. The compilation film was directed by Fūga Yamashiro and written by Hiroshi Seko.</ns2:sourceSummary>
