    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Fire Inside is a 2024 American biographical sports drama film by Rachel Morrison in her feature directorial debut. The film is about the early boxing career of Claressa "T-Rex" Shields, a fighter from Flint, Michigan, including her competing at the 2012 Summer Olympics. Ryan Destiny stars as Shields, alongside Brian Tyree Henry and Adam Clark.</ns2:sourceSummary>
