    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bhalle Padharya is a 2024 Gujarati horror comedy directed by Maniesh Kumar Madhav and written by Maniesh Kumar Madhav &amp; Maulik Arvind Vekariya. It stars Bharat Chawda, Prem Gadhavi Saurabh Rajyaguru and others. The film is produced by Puja N Madhav and Co Produced by Durgesh Tanna, Garima Nandu &amp; Dev Rao Jadhav. The film will be distributed by Rupam Entertainment Pvt Ltd.</ns2:sourceSummary>
