    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bionico's Bachata is a 2024 Dominican mockumentary comedy-drama film co-written, co-produced, co-edited and directed by Yoel Morales. It is a free and acid reinterpretation Romeo and Juliet by William Shakespeare, starring Manuel Raposo as a romantic drug addict who must take control of his life before his fiancée leaves rehab.</ns2:sourceSummary>
