    <ns2:hasCountry rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_united_states"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bone Lake is a 2024 American erotic thriller film directed by Mercedes Bryce Morgan and written by Joshua Friedlander. Maddie Hasson and Marco Pigossi play a couple whose getaway at a remote lakeside house is interrupted by another mysterious couple, played by Alex Roe and Andra Nechita, leading to a disturbing series of mind games and manipulation.</ns2:sourceSummary>
