    <ns2:sourceSummary>The Gatekeeper is a 2024 Philippine supernatural mystery folk horror film directed by Matthew and Dean Rosen from the screenplay of Dean Rosen and Zoe Alcazaren. Shanaia Gomez plays Cita, the actress's first lead role. The film is about a woman discovering a strange cabinet that also serves as a portal to underworld.</ns2:sourceSummary>
