    <ns2:imdbId>tt35698739</ns2:imdbId>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Ghosts of the Sea is a Canadian-French multimedia book and documentary film project by Virginia Tangvald, released in 2024. The book and the film both centre on her search for more information and understanding about her father, Norwegian adventurer Peter Tangvald, and her brother, Thomas Tangvald, who both died in separate shipwreck incidents in 1991 and 2014.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>Ghosts of the Sea</ns2:title>
