    <rdfs:label>Brief History of a Family</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Brief History of a Family, is a 2024 psychological thriller film written and directed by Lin Jianjie in his feature directorial debut. The film, starring Zu Feng, Guo Keyu, Sun Xilun, and Lin Muran depicts a middle-class Chinese family in the post-one-child-policy era, who takes in their only son's mysterious new friend, triggering buried family tensions as secrets and feelings surface.</ns2:sourceSummary>
