    <ns2:pageURL rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damaged_(film)</ns2:pageURL>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Damaged is a 2024 crime thriller film directed by Terry McDonough and starring Samuel L. Jackson, Vincent Cassel and Gianni Capaldi. It follows Chicago-based detective Dan Lawson (Jackson) who investigates a string of serial killings in Scotland alongside another detective, Walker Bravo (Cassel). As the case continues, Lawson discovers a pattern similar to another killing spree he handled five years prior.</ns2:sourceSummary>
