    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bitter Gold is a 2024 neo-Western thriller drama film directed by Juan Francisco Olea. The film stars Francisco Melo and Katalina Sánchez as a gold miner and his teenage daughter who defend an illegal gold mine from other miners who want to steal from them. It is a co-production between Chile, Germany, Mexico and Uruguay.</ns2:sourceSummary>
