    <ns2:sourceSummary>Blood and Black is a 2024 Indian Tamil-language horror thriller film written and directed by Guru Karthikeyan. The film stars Sugi Vijay and Yanni Jackson. The film was produced by Hari Krishnan Vasudevan under the banner of Blue whale entertainments.</ns2:sourceSummary>
