    <ns2:sourceSummary>GG: Good Game is a 2024 Philippine teen sports drama film directed by Prime Cruz and written by Cruz along with Zachary Aquino and Hannah Pangilinan. The film stars Pangilinan's brother Donny Pangilinan, Igi Boy Flores, and Ronaldo Valdez. Set against the backdrop of the Philippine esports scene, the film follows the journey of a group of young gamers striving to make their mark in the competitive world of professional gaming.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>GG: Good Game</ns2:title>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
