    <ns2:sourceSummary>Daddy's Head is a 2024 British horror film directed by Benjamin Barfoot starring Rupert Turnbull, Julia Brown and Charles Aitken. It plot follows Isaac (Turnbull) and his stepmother Laura (Brown) who are haunted by a strange creature that starts walking around the house after the funeral of his father James (Aitken).</ns2:sourceSummary>
