    <ns2:sourceSummary>Deepavali Bonus is a 2024 Indian Tamil-language drama film directed by Jeyabal .J. The film stars Vikranth and Riythvika in lead roles. The film is produced by Deepak Kumar Tala of Sri Ankali Parameswari Productions, while the technical crew consists of music composer Maria Jerald, cinematographer Gautham Sethuram, and editor Parthiv Murugan. Deepavali Bonus released in theatres on 25 October 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
