    <ns2:sourceSummary>Behuli from Meghauli is a 2024 Nepalese comedy-drama film written and directed by Sajan Kafle and Aakash Baral. The film is produced by Nischal Basnet and Swastima Khadka under the banner of Black Horse Pictures and Meghauli Films. The film stars the producer duo, Nischal Basnet and Swastima Khadka in lead roles alongside Basundhara Bhusal, Bijay Baral, Rakshya Thapa, Simran Khadka as supporting cast.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>Behuli from Meghauli</ns2:title>
