    <ns2:sourceSummary>Carole &amp; Grey is a 2024 feature film that was made for TikTok and released in 45 episodes. Written by and starring Jon Bass, it also starred Mary Wiseman, Steve Buscemi, Rosaline Elbay, Dario Ladani Sanchez, and Daniel Radcliffe.</ns2:sourceSummary>
