    <ns2:title>Cat's Cry (film)</ns2:title>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Cat's Cry is a drama film, directed by Sanja Živković and released in 2024. A coproduction of companies from Serbia, Canada and Croatia, the film stars Jasmin Geljo as Stamen, a man living in a small town in Serbia who must fight for custody of his granddaughter when she is rejected by her mother after being diagnosed with cri du chat syndrome.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:pageURL rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat's_Cry_(film)</ns2:pageURL>
