    <ns2:sourceSummary>Babai Ghahraman is an Iranian animated film directed by Hossein Saffarzadegan and Meysam Hosseini, written by Meqdad Akhavan, and produced by Mohammad Mehdi Mashkoori in 2023 by the Owj Art Organization, which was screened at the 42nd Fajr International Film Festival in 2024.</ns2:sourceSummary>
