    <ns2:sourceSummary>¡Casa Bonita Mi Amor! is a 2024 American documentary film directed by Arthur Bradford. It is about Trey Parker and Matt Stone buying Casa Bonita, a Mexican restaurant in Colorado that was a prominent setting in a 2003 South Park episode titled "Casa Bonita". Parker and Stone spend over $30 million of their own money renovating the decaying restaurant, far over their original $6.5 million budget.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:pageURL rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C2%A1Casa_Bonita_Mi_Amor!</ns2:pageURL>
