    <ns2:sourceSummary>Chitti Potti is a 2024 Telugu-language drama film directed and produced by Bhaskar Yadav Dasari under the banner of Bhaskara Group of Media. The film explores the emotional depth of sibling bonds and family relationships, spanning three generations. The cast includes Pavithra, Ram Mittakanti, Kashvi, Kanthamma, Achari, Harsha, Satish, and Sarala.</ns2:sourceSummary>
