    <rdfs:label>Avicii – I'm Tim</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Avicii – I'm Tim is a 2024 documentary film about the life of Swedish DJ Avicii. The film premiered at the Tribeca Festival on June 9, 2024. It is directed by Swedish director Henrik Burman, produced by Björn Tjärnberg, and features interviews from Chris Martin, Nile Rodgers and David Guetta among others.</ns2:sourceSummary>
