    <ns2:imdbId>tt33509234</ns2:imdbId>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Blossoms Under Somewhere is a 2024 Hong Kong drama film directed and co-written by Riley Yip, marking her directorial debut as part of the First Feature Film Initiative, and produced by Fruit Chan. Starring Marife Yau and Sheena Chan as a pair of schoolgirls, the film explores their experiences while selling lingerie they have worn online and the unexpected attention they attracted.</ns2:sourceSummary>
