    <ns2:title>Gaslit By My Husband: The Morgan Metzer Story</ns2:title>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Gaslit By My Husband: The Morgan Metzer Story is a 2024 Lifetime drama directed by Lee Gabiana. The movie follows the true story of Morgan Metzer's abusive marriage to ex-husband Rodney Metzer, including a violent attack he orchestrated against her.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:pageURL rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaslit_By_My_Husband%3A_The_Morgan_Metzer_Story</ns2:pageURL>
