    <ns2:directedBy rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_simple_suni"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Avatara Purusha 2 is a 2024 Indian Kannada-language supernatural comedy thriller film written and directed by Suni and produced by Pushkara Mallikarjunaiah under his banner Pushkar Films. It stars Sharan and Ashika Ranganath in the lead roles. P. Sai Kumar, Bhavya, Balaji Manohar, and Srinagar Kitty feature in supporting roles. Abhinandan Kashyap composed the music while William David served as the cinematographer.</ns2:sourceSummary>
  </rdf:Description>
