    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#Film"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Bharatha Puzha is a 2024 Indian Malayalam-language drama film written and directed by Manilal. It tells the story of Sugandhi, a sex worker who attempts to navigate through the social mores of life around her. Her journeys transgress gender and class divisions, and explore relationships.</ns2:sourceSummary>
