    <rdfs:label>Beat Ronaldo, Win $1,000,000</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Beat Ronaldo, Win $1,000,000 is a YouTube challenge video by Jimmy Donaldson (MrBeast), released on December 1, 2024. The video features top-tier athletes—including Cristiano Ronaldo, Tom Brady, Noah Lyles, Bryce Harper, and Bryson DeChambeau—competing against fans in sports-based contests for cash prizes and exposure.</ns2:sourceSummary>
