    <ns2:sourceSummary>Beaupré the Giant is a Canadian animated short film, written and directed by Alain Fournier and released in 2024. The film centres on the life and death of Édouard Beaupré, a Canadian man who was one of the tallest men in recorded history and who spent his life as a circus and freak show performer.</ns2:sourceSummary>
