    <ns2:hasOriginalLanguage rdf:resource="http://example.org/movie#entity_tagalog"/>
    <ns2:sourceSummary>G! LU is a 2024 Filipino comedy film written and directed by Philip King, starring David Licauco, Kiko Estrada, Derrick Monasterio, Ruru Madrid, Teejay Marquez, and Enzo Pineda. The film released on April 24, 2024. It is the directoral debut of Philip King. The film focuses on various issues like mental health, gender and love issues.</ns2:sourceSummary>
    <ns2:title>G! LU</ns2:title>
