  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/movie#film_Q124355779">
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Chime is a 2024 Japanese psychological horror short film written and directed by Kiyoshi Kurosawa. It stars Mutsuo Yoshioka as a cooking teacher, whose life is disrupted by a chime which induces violent and erratic behaviour in those who hear it.</ns2:sourceSummary>
