  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/movie#film_Q131092696">
    <ns2:sourceSummary>Appudo Ippudo Eppudo is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language action comedy film written and directed by Sudheer Varma, and produced by B. V. S. N. Prasad through Sri Venkateswara Cine Chitra. The film features Nikhil Siddhartha, Rukmini Vasanth and Divyansha Kaushik in important roles. The film is named after the song of the same name in Bommarillu (2006).</ns2:sourceSummary>
